### 3.2 Visual Level Controls & Precision Gestures
* **Bottom-Up & Center-Zero Visual Faders:** Every fader displays a glowing track-colored fill bar with high-contrast thumb caps and numeric readouts; bipolar controls (Pan, Fine Detune, Filter Env Depth, Micro-Timing, Crossfaders) fill outward from a center-zero line.
