* **Expandable Bottom Deck (`⤢ EXPAND / FOCUS` Toggle):** Expands Zone 3 smoothly from $45\%$ to **$78\%$ screen height** (collapsing Zone 2 into a compact 1-line mini-playhead strip) during deep Pro synthesis, Piano Roll editing, or full-screen Live Performance Clip Launching, then collapses back to the full 8-track overview in one tap.

