  * `FM DIRT` $\rightarrow$ *"Robot Grit 🤖"*
  * `AMP DECAY` $\rightarrow$ *"Tail Length ☄️"*
  * `PITCH ENV` $\rightarrow$ *"Zap Punch ⚡"*
  * `DETUNE` $\rightarrow$ *"Super Wide 🌈"*
* **Dual-Workflow Parameter Locks (`Hold-Step` + `🔒 P-LOCK` Latch Mode):**
