  * **Single-Pointer `🔒 P-LOCK` Latch Button:** Toggle `P-LOCK` ON next to `RECORD`, tap any step to select it with a glowing amber frame, and adjust any number of synth sliders using a single mouse cursor or one-handed tablet hold.
