  * **Dual-Deck `A / B` Pattern Crossfader:** Assign any pattern (or custom multi-track clip combination) to **Deck A** and another to **Deck B**, then glide a wide horizontal **Pattern Crossfader** between them with **3 Selectable Crossfade Modes**:
    1. **`DJ EQ / GAIN BLEND`:** Smoothly fades Deck A out while bringing Deck B in, featuring an automatic **Low-End Bass Swap** curve so two kicks or sub-basses never double-up and clip the master limiter.
    2. **`FILTER MORPH`:** High-passes Deck A out into thin air while smoothly opening a warm low-pass filter on Deck B.
    3. **`STEP PROBABILITY MORPH` (Generative Transition):** As the crossfader slides from $0\%$ to $100\%$, each step progressively switches its trigger source from Pattern A to Pattern B—creating an organic rhythmic mutation between the two patterns mid-transition.
  * **Momentary Punch-In FX Pads (`SP-404` / `OP-Z` Style):** Hold down oversized tactile pads to apply temporary performance effects that snap cleanly back on release:
    * **`TAPE STOP`** (vinyl brake pitch/tempo slowdown)
    * **`BEAT REPEAT`** (`1/8`, `1/16`, `1/32` rhythmic stutter)
    * **`DUB WASH OUT`** ($100\%$ Reverb/Delay echo throw)
    * **`808 SUB DROP`** (synthesized sub-bass boom impact)
    * **`HPF RISER`** (instant high-pass tension sweep)
  * **Capture Combination (`📸 CAPTURE TO PATTERN / SONG`):** One-tap capture freezes the currently active mix-and-match track combination into a new pattern slot (`D1–D4`) or appends it directly as a block in the **Song Arranger** timeline.

#### Tab 6: `PIANO ROLL & SONG` (Extendable Notes, Visual Velocity/Timing Lanes, Song Arranger & Exports)
* **Melodic Piano Roll + Synchronized Bottom Velocity & Micro-Timing Lane:**
  * **Folded Scale Grid (Default) with Functional Row Coloring:** Hides out-of-key rows so every horizontal pitch lane is in-key and finger-sized, showing **Home / Color / Tension** row tints and draggable right-edge note length bars + **`GATE %` Slider** ($25\%$ staccato pluck to $100\%$ legato tie).
  * **`🪄 ANSWER ME` (2-Bar Call-and-Response Co-Play):** Analyzes a 1-bar "Call" melody in `Bar 1` and generates a complementary, rhythmically mirrored "Response" melody in `Bar 2` that resolves onto a Home note.
  * **Per-Track, Per-Note Visual Velocity Lane (Docked Directly Below Piano Roll & Step Grid):**
    * Displays vertical **Velocity Stems & Caps ($1\text{–}127$ / $0\text{–}100\%$)** aligned directly under every note/step in the track's neon color.
    * **Swipe-to-Sculpt Gestures:** Drag individual bars up/down or swipe horizontally across all 16 steps to draw smooth hi-hat crescendos, snare rolls, and human grooves in one sweep. In polyphonic chords, tapping an individual note highlights its dedicated velocity stem.
    * **One-Tap Velocity Tools:** `ACCENT 1/4`, `UP RAMP`, `DOWN RAMP`, `ALTERNATE`, `HUMANIZE (±15%)`.
    * **Micro-Timing Nudge Sub-Lane (Pro):** Slide individual steps early or late ($-50\%$ to $+50\%$ of a step) for Dilla-style pocket and laid-back grooves.
* **Linear Song Arranger, Web MIDI & Multi-Format Export:**
  * Arrange pattern blocks (`A1–D4`) with repeat counts ($\times 1$, $\times 2$, $\times 4$, $\times 8$) and **Per-Block Mute & Master Filter Overrides**.
  * **Performance Macros ($1\text{–}8$):** Assignable multi-parameter macro sliders for live song transitions.
  * **Web MIDI I/O & Clock Sync:** Bidirectional USB-C/Bluetooth MIDI note input, `MIDI Learn` CC mapping, and MIDI Clock Start/Stop/Continue sync.
  * **Multi-Format Exports:**
    * **`EXPORT MASTER WAV`** (renders stereo master via `OfflineAudioContext` through the 3-stage Mastering Strip).
    * **`EXPORT 8 STEMS (.WAV)`** (renders isolated Kick, Snare, Hat, Perc, Bass, Lead, Chords, and Arp `.wav` stems for DAW mixing).
    * **`EXPORT MIDI (.MID)`** (exports multi-track Standard MIDI File preserving extendable note durations, velocities, and micro-timing).

