## 5. Desktop PC Keyboard Shortcuts & QWERTY Note Input (`STUDIO` Mode)
* **`Space`:** Play / Stop
* **`R`:** Toggle Global Overdub Record
* **`1`–`8`:** Select & Focus Track `1`–`8`
* **`M` / `S`:** Mute / Solo focused track
* **`L`:** Toggle `🔒 P-LOCK` Latch Mode
* **`Ctrl/Cmd + Z` / `Ctrl/Cmd + Shift + Z`:** Undo / Redo
* **`Shift + Pointer Drag`:** Engage $10\times$ Fine Precision control on any fader/knob
* **`A S D F G H J K` & `W E T Y U`:** Play live scale/chromatic notes on the focused track without an external MIDI keyboard (`Z` / `X` shift octave down/up).

