### Decoupled `IndexedDB` Storage Stores & Export Formats
1. **`working_session`:** Continuous autosave of active session state.
2. **`projects`:** Self-contained full project snapshots (patterns, extendable note ties, per-track live performance routing, song arrangement, embedded synth/insert FX settings, macros, scenes, MIDI CC mappings).
3. **`global_track_presets`:** Shared single-track patches accessible across all projects (Factory + User presets).
4. **`global_kits`:** Shared 8-track sound/mixer palettes loadable into any project without overwriting patterns.
5. **Portable File Exports:** `.json` project bundles, `.mid` multi-track Standard MIDI Files, stereo mastered `.wav`, isolated 8-track `.wav` stems, and live resampled `.wav` loops.